.TH CHMOD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
chmod \- change file permissions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/stat.h>
.B int chmod(const char* path, mode_t mode);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes the permissions of the file named by path to Linux mode bits.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fchmod (3crunch),
.BR chmod (2)
